WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:02.380
Bennu, and a handful brought home.

00:03.080 --> 00:05.692
Bennu is about half a kilometre wide.

00:06.142 --> 00:17.767
A spacecraft touched it, collected a hundred and twenty grams, and dropped them in the Utah desert in 2023: the largest asteroid sample ever brought home.

00:18.217 --> 00:23.013
In that dust were sugars and other molecules that, on Earth, are key to life.
